    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "<br> Awesome is the only way to describe 'Sea Zen', this newly remodeled home located next to Rosemary Beach and only 150 yards to beach. After a day at the beach relax in your own 18 x 36 heated pool surrounded by tropical landscaping. Let the kids swim while you grill dinner beside the private pool.<br><br>Everyone can spread out in the six large bedrooms, five baths, plus a den with a sleeper sofa, where the kids can hang out in their own space. There are flat screen TV's in all bedrooms and living room, the gourmet kitchen features a Kitchen Aide professional range with plenty of counter space.<br><br>Downstairs, there are 3 king bedrooms. Upstairs there is one king bedroom and one <br>bedroom with a queen bed. The large bunk room has 4 full size bunk beds and 6 single beds sleeping 10 people. There is also a queen sleeper sofa in the first floor children's media room.<br>There are 2 wooden high chairs, 2 Pack N Plays.<br><br>Everyone can enjoy a meal together with a large 10 foot dining table seating 12, plus a large breakfast bar for 6. You will enjoy the open floor plan upstairs, with 2 open living rooms, kitchen, and dining room offering expansive gulf views.<br><br>- March 5- October 31 one free beach set up with umbrella and 2 chairs at the Winston lane or South Wall street or Orange street beach access. You are welcome to add additional ones at Coastal Parasal (850) 233-0914.<br>- Private heated pool **Pool heating available Oct 1-May 31 $400 weekly/ $65 daily.<br>- 6 person street legal golf cart available for rent $700 weekly. License only drivers to operate street legal golf cart. <br><br> Need baby gear during your stay? Rent cribs, car seats, strollers, toys and more from BabyQuip! As seen on Shark Tank, BabyQuip offers clean, sanitized, and safe baby gear in over 650 cities! Visit https://www.babyquip.com/a/hci6sp to make a reservation.<br><br><br>Keywords: Very Open floor plan high end finishes. Large pool and private outdoor entertaining area. Amazing gulf views and only a 3 minute walk to the beach.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
