          }
        ],
        "text": "This house was amazing for my bachelorette trip we had the best time! The property owner was so responsive and helpful, Ross made this stay so enjoyable. Huge standouts were the large tables that could fit our group all together for eating dinners, a quick walk to the beach with chairs and umbrellas set up on our arrival, and a great outdoor space to enjoy the sun in! To make things even better the beds were all so comfy and plenty of towels for everyone to use! Couldn’t recommend this house more, I will definitely be rebooking for future trips!",
